<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76512" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πά̆θ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>passive state</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				80b
			</span></i>; <i>what is done</i> or <i>happens</i> to a person
			orthing, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶξις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				903b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epin.</u>
				983d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἐκεῖ . . π.</span>
			<i>what happened</i> there, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				295
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσαν τὴν ἑωντοῦ π.</span> all
				<i>that had happened</i> to him, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.122
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>suffering, misfortune</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.42
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				97
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				7
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθαι</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐτυχίαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.40
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν</span>
			blindness, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.111
			</span></i>; of <i>morbid affections</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς π. τὰς ἐν τῷ ὀστέῳ γινομένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VC</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ πνίγους π.</span>
			suffocation, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				32a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				728c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				865e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				866b
			</span></i>.</div>
